With 2ˣ = t we have 4ˣ = (2ˣ)² = t², so t² − {=(-nums(eq)[1])}t + {=nums(eq)[3]} = 0
The two numbers with sum {=(-nums(eq)[1])} and product {=nums(eq)[3]} are {=pair((-nums(eq)[1]),nums(eq)[3])}, so it factors
The smaller one is {answer}
